      "heading": "Mengelola Reactions",
      "id": "manage-reactions",
      "intro": "Reactions adalah aksi yang dijalankan setelah rule mendeteksi fraud. Misalnya: mengirim email, memblokir transaksi, atau mengirim notifikasi ke tim.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa Itu Reactions?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Email** — Kirim notifikasi ke tim fraud\n• **Block Transaction** — Blokir transaksi otomatis\n• **API Call** — Panggil webhook/API eksternal\n• **SMS** — Kirim SMS ke petugas\n• Reactions diatur per rule, tidak global",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fdf2f8;border:1px solid #f9a8d4;font-size:7px;color:#be185d\">📧 Email</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:7px;color:#dc2626\">🚫 Block</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:7px;color:#2563eb\">🔗 API</span><span style=\"padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:7px;color:#16a34a\">📱 SMS</span></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
