          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Saat mengedit rule, cari bagian **Reactions**\n• Klik **+ Tambah Reaction**, pilih jenis\n• Atur parameter (email tujuan, URL API, nomor SMS, dll)\n• Satu rule bisa punya beberapa reactions",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a\">Reactions</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f59e0b;font-size:7px;color:#fff;font-weight:600\">+ Tambah</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b\">📧 fraud-team@company.com</div></div>"
